<h1>A ₹30,000 credit limit</h1>
<p>The limit is not income. Spending ₹8,000 and paying only the minimum can leave a balance that grows with interest.</p>
<form method="post" class="grid">
    <button class="choice" name="choice" value="full">Spend a little and pay the full bill</button>
    <button class="choice" name="choice" value="minimum">Pay only the minimum</button>
    <button class="choice" name="choice" value="skip">Leave the limit unused</button>
</form>
